h\" >Flying <strong>rocket pins</strong> that will chase you down!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mortar pins</strong> that will relentlessly barrage your location!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joker pins</strong> that when struck down destroy your precious combos!<br>With many more to discover as you climb the leaderboard!</p></li></ul>",
